    },
    "A hidden tab stays pinned; only this %@ leaves it out. Edit, then drag a tab to change its place everywhere." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A hidden tab stays pinned; only this %@ leaves it out. Edit, then drag a tab to change its place everywhere."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "가려진 탭도 고정 상태를 유지합니다. 이 %@에서만 표시되지 않습니다. 모든 곳에서 순서를 변경하려면 편집을 누른 후 탭을 드래그해 주세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little window keeps a link to itself until you open it in a tab with ⌃⌥O. A Peek shows a page over the tab it came from; pop-ups open in one too. ⌃⌥O opens it in a tab, ⌘W closes it." : {

    },
